{"seq":1,"slug":"completion-acceptance-warranty-model","title":"完工验收模型：签收确认、验收标准与安装质保","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/completion-aftersales/completion-acceptance-warranty-model","wordCount":2994,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"完工验收模型-签收确认-验收标准与安装质保\">完工验收模型：签收确认、验收标准与安装质保</h1><p>技师把最后一块背板卡进卡槽、拧紧四颗螺丝的那一刻，系统里的工单并没有「完成」——它只是从<strong>作业可信</strong>走到了<strong>待验收</strong>。跨境安装服务的商业实质是：客户买的不是工时，而是「装好且能用」这一结果。因此完工验收不是一次表单填写，而是把「现场发生了服务事实」转化为「平台承担履约责任」的<strong>契约动作</strong>，并向后延伸出一条责任尾巴——安装质保。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-验收是事实转责任的契约动作\">核心概念：验收是事实转责任的契约动作</h2><p>完工验收在工程上要回答三个彼此独立的问题，任何一个搞混都会导致争议：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>作业是否按标准完成？</strong>（判据向量是否全部为真）</li>\n<li><strong>客户是否知情并接受该结果？</strong>（签收证据是否成立）</li>\n<li><strong>平台是否据此对外承诺？</strong>（过账与质保期是否开启）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三者分别对应<strong>验收标准</strong>、<strong>签收证据链</strong>、<strong>质保开启</strong>。把它们压成一个 <code>status = done</code> 字段，是这类系统最典型的建模错误：一旦压平，「客户签了但判据没全过」「判据全过但客户拒签」「签了但后台未复核」这些常见的中间态就无处存放。</p>\n<p>参照成熟产品的做法：Dynamics 365 Field Service 把工单生命周期拆成<strong>工单系统状态</strong>（Unscheduled / Scheduled / In Progress / Completed / Posted / Canceled）、<strong>工单子状态</strong>与<strong>排班状态</strong>三个正交维度，排班进入 <code>Completed</code> 时才写入实际结束时间、生成 Booking Journal 以计算工时与差旅；而工单系统状态只有在<strong>所有</strong>关联排班都完成或取消后，才跟随进入 <code>Completed</code>（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/field-service/work-order-status-booking-status\">Microsoft Learn: Work order lifecycle and system statuses</a>，2026-08 更新）。这印证了关键设计：<strong>验收是独立的里程碑，而非完成事件的同义词</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"验收标准的可执行化-从主观满意到客观判据\">验收标准的可执行化：从主观满意到客观判据</h2><p>「客户满意」不是判据，它是判据的结果。可执行的验收标准必须把主观判断降解为一组<strong>可观测、可举证、可判定</strong>的条件。跨境电商的上门安装通常落入四类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>功能判据</strong>：通电自检通过、联动/联网成功、试运行一个完整周期无异常。</li>\n<li><strong>外观判据</strong>：无划痕、无歪斜、缝隙均匀、保护膜按约定撕除。</li>\n<li><strong>安规判据</strong>：接地可靠、燃气/水路接口检漏合格、承重件固定到位、线缆不在通行路径上——这类判据同时是<strong>保险理赔与品牌责任</strong>的凭据。</li>\n<li><strong>文档判据</strong>：说明书、保修卡、耗材清单、旧件处置确认单是否交付。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把每一类判据记为布尔量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i \\in \\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，一次验收成立的条件是一个合取：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Accept</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>⋀</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>Sig</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Accept} = \\bigwedge_{i=1}^{n} c_i \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{Sig}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Accept</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋀</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sig</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Sig</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Sig}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sig</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是客户签署谓词。任何单项为假，验收即不成立——「几乎全过」在法律与结算上等价于「未完成」。对于阈值型判据（如噪声、水平度、水压保持），把布尔量替换为带阈值的比较，并将原始观测值一并留痕：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i = \\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[\\, v_i \\le \\tau_i \\,\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而不是只保留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是有意的</strong>。当客户事后主张「当时就晃」，只有原始观测值能说明当时测得了什么；只存一个 <code>pass</code> 无法自证。判据表版本同样要留痕——产品线更新后判据会变，需能回答「这一单当时适用哪一版标准」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"签收证据链-电子签名-影像-时间戳与不可否认性\">签收证据链：电子签名、影像、时间戳与不可否认性</h2><p>签收的工程目标是<strong>不可否认性</strong>（non-repudiation）：签署后，客户不能合理地否认「我签过」，平台也不能合理地否认「我展示过什么」。这条性质由证据的<strong>完整性</strong>与<strong>绑定关系</strong>共同决定。</p>\n<p>电子签名的法律底座在两个主要市场都已确立：美国 ESIGN Act（15 U.S.C. §7001，2000 年）确立电子签名与手写签名同等效力；欧盟 eIDAS 条例（(EU) No 910/2014）把电子签名分为<strong>简单（SES）</strong>、**高级（AES）<strong>与</strong>合格（QES）**三级，QES 在法律上等同于手写签名。多数平台在安装签收场景使用 AES 级别方案（签署意图声明 + 签署者身份绑定 + 可检测篡改），高价值家居合同则可能要求 QES。</p>\n<p>一份可用的签收证据对象至少包含五个互相<strong>绑定</strong>的字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>绑定方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>签署影像</td>\n<td>证明客户本人在场</td>\n<td>与工单 ID 绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手写/点击签名</td>\n<td>表达接受的意思表示</td>\n<td>与判据版本哈希绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理坐标</td>\n<td>证明签署发生在服务地址</td>\n<td>与设备时钟共同留痕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间戳</td>\n<td>确定质保起算点</td>\n<td>服务端接收时钟为准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容哈希</td>\n<td>证明所签文本未被改写</td>\n<td>与判据表版本绑定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>内容哈希是这条链的锚点，把「客户签署的到底是什么」压缩成一个摘要：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>judgeSet</mtext><mo>∥</mo><mtext>termsVer</mtext><mo>∥</mo><mtext>orderId</mtext><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>sign</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = H(\\text{judgeSet} \\parallel \\text{termsVer} \\parallel \\text{orderId} \\parallel t_{\\text{sign}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">judgeSet</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">termsVer</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">orderId</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sign</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>签署动作记录的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 一旦入库只读，任何后续对判据或条款的修改都会使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 失配而被检测到。容易忽略的细节：<strong>时间戳要用服务端接收时钟，而不是设备本地时钟</strong>——设备时间可被用户任意调整，用它做质保起算点等于把倒计时交给客户控制。</p>\n<p>跨境场景还要处理三种非标准签收，它们必须是一等路径而非异常兜底：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>代签</strong>：客户不在场，由家人/物业/前台代签。签署者身份与收货人不一致，需额外授权声明，且部分含安规责任的安装不允许代签。</li>\n<li><strong>拒签</strong>：客户拒绝签署。系统必须记录<strong>拒签原因</strong>与现场证据，而不是简单置为失败——拒签原因是后续争议、返工或超时自动验收策略的输入。</li>\n<li><strong>超时自动验收</strong>：部分品类约定「完工后 48 小时无异议视为验收」，但必须能追溯到事前明确告知，否则在消费者保护法下站不住。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[完工上报] --&gt; Q[推送验收请求&lt;br/&gt;短信/邮件/App]&#10;  Q --&gt; R{客户响应?}&#10;  R --&gt;|在场签署| S[采集签名+影像+GPS]&#10;  R --&gt;|不在场| T[触发授权代签或&lt;br/&gt;超时自动验收倒计时]&#10;  R --&gt;|明确拒签| U[记录原因+现场证据]&#10;  S --&gt; V[计算内容哈希并入库只读]&#10;  T --&gt; W{倒计时内异议?}&#10;  W --&gt;|无| V&#10;  W --&gt;|有| U&#10;  V --&gt; X[验收成立]&#10;  U --&gt; Y[转争议/返工流程]\">flowchart TD\n  P[完工上报] --&gt; Q[推送验收请求&lt;br/&gt;短信/邮件/App]\n  Q --&gt; R{客户响应?}\n  R --&gt;|在场签署| S[采集签名+影像+GPS]\n  R --&gt;|不在场| T[触发授权代签或&lt;br/&gt;超时自动验收倒计时]\n  R --&gt;|明确拒签| U[记录原因+现场证据]\n  S --&gt; V[计算内容哈希并入库只读]\n  T --&gt; W{倒计时内异议?}\n  W --&gt;|无| V\n  W --&gt;|有| U\n  V --&gt; X[验收成立]\n  U --&gt; Y[转争议/返工流程]</pre><h2 id=\"安装质保的建模-法定保证-商业质保与手艺质保的分层\">安装质保的建模：法定保证、商业质保与手艺质保的分层</h2><p>「质保」在实践中被混用成一个词，但工程上必须拆成三层，因为它们的<strong>责任方、时长与终止条件</strong>完全不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>法定保证（statutory guarantee / legal warranty）</strong>：由法律强制，不可被合同排除。欧盟规定消费品至少有 <strong>2 年</strong>法定保证期，商家须<strong>免费</strong>维修或更换缺陷商品（<a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/guarantees-returns/index_en.htm\">Your Europe: Guarantees and returns</a>，2026 查阅）。</li>\n<li><strong>商业质保（commercial warranty）</strong>：平台/品牌额外承诺的条款，通常延长年限或扩大范围（如「免费上门保养一次」）。它可以被约定，但<strong>不能低于</strong>法定保证。</li>\n<li><strong>手艺质保（workmanship warranty）</strong>：针对安装<strong>作业本身</strong>的质量承诺，与产品缺陷无关，典型时长远短于产品质保（业界常见 90 天至 1 年），因为安装质量问题在短期内就会显现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三层的关系决定了售后请求的路由：客户报「装完三天后柜门掉了」——五金件本身断裂走产品质保，没拧紧走手艺质保；两者的处理链路与成本承担方不同。<strong>把两者混在一个入口，是售后扯皮的第一大原因</strong>。</p>\n<p>质保期的起算点也不应以「下单时间」或「签收时间」为默认，而应以<strong>验收成立时刻</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{accept}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为基准，因为验收才是责任开启的时刻：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>expire</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>warranty</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{expire}} = t_{\\text{accept}} + \\Delta_{\\text{warranty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expire</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">warranty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>跨境还有一个常被忽视的冲突：<strong>消费者的撤回权（right of withdrawal）与质保期并非同一回事</strong>。欧盟规则下，远程或场外订立的服务合同，消费者有 <strong>14 天</strong>冷静期可无理由取消；但若服务<strong>已完整履行</strong>且消费者事前明确同意立即开始履行并确认将丧失取消权，则该权利终止（<a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/returns/index_en.htm\">Your Europe: Returns</a>，2026 查阅）。这意味着「客户签了字」并不自动等于「撤回权已消灭」——<strong>必须有事前的明确告知与同意留痕</strong>。对美国上门的场外销售，联邦冷静期规则（FTC Cooling-Off Rule，16 CFR Part 429）要求给予 <strong>3 个营业日</strong>的取消权。工程含义是：<strong>验收流程里必须嵌入「权利告知」步骤</strong>，其证据与签收证据一同留痕。</p>\n<h2 id=\"售后触发与返工-把质保索赔转成可调度的再履约\">售后触发与返工：把质保索赔转成可调度的再履约</h2><p>质保不是一句承诺，它是<strong>一个必须能被调度的工单来源</strong>。质保期内客户发起索赔时，系统要完成三步转换：判定层次（产品/手艺/法定）→ 判定责任（品牌/平台/技师）→ 生成可派工的任务。</p>\n<p>这一转换的关键设计是<strong>复用已有的调度管线而不是另建一条</strong>。返工工单在结构上就是一次新的上门服务：它需要技师、时段、备件与工具，因此应当携带一个指向原始工单的<strong>父引用</strong>，以便优先级可被抬高（返工通常比新单更急）、判据表沿用原始版本（避免用新版标准评判旧作业）、成本被正确归集到责任方。</p>\n<p>监控这套闭环的核心指标是<strong>返工率</strong>与<strong>一次验收通过率</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Rework Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>completed</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>FPY</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Rework Rate</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Rework Rate} = \\frac{N_{\\text{rework}}}{N_{\\text{completed}}}\n, \\qquad\n\\text{FPY} = 1 - \\text{Rework Rate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rework Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">completed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FPY</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rework Rate</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>FPY（first-pass yield）按<strong>技师 × 品类 × 判据项</strong>三个维度下钻，才能定位到真实原因：整体 FPY 从 92% 掉到 88% 只是信号，「A 品类在 B 技师上的安规判据不通过率翻倍」才是可行动的信息。</p>\n<p>跨境场景还给这条闭环加了两道约束。其一，<strong>质保的履行地域</strong>可能不同于原始安装地，平台需预先定义质保是「原地履行」「全国履行」还是「仅原始地址履行」，这直接决定返工工单能否被调度到可行解。其二，<strong>备件与工具的可得性</strong>在跨境链路里显著更差，返工常因缺件而二次上门，因此返工工单创建时就要做备件可用性预检——这与<a href=\"../field-execution-delivery/parts-tools-mobile-inventory\">备件与移动库存模型</a>中「库存是可派工约束」的立场一致。</p>\n<p>验收模型的另一端连着<a href=\"../field-execution-delivery/field-workorder-state-evidence\">工单状态机与作业证据留痕</a>：验收事件本身就是状态机上 <code>Completed → Signed Off</code> 这条带守卫的迁移，守卫即「判据全通过 且 签收证据成立」。把它建成独立事件类型而非复用工单的字段更新，证据链才保持可回放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>完工验收是<strong>事实转责任的契约动作</strong>，必须拆成「作业达标」「客户接受」「平台承诺」三个独立判据，压成单一状态字段必然丢失关键中间态。</li>\n<li>判据要可执行、可举证、可版本化：合取式 <code>Accept = ∧c_i ∧ Sig</code>；阈值型判据要<strong>连同原始观测值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一起留痕</strong>。</li>\n<li>签收证据链以<strong>内容哈希</strong>为锚，时间戳以服务端接收时钟为准；代签、拒签、超时自动验收都是一等路径。</li>\n<li>质保分<strong>法定保证 / 商业质保 / 手艺质保</strong>三层，起算点是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{accept}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；跨境还要把撤回权告知（欧盟 14 天、美国 3 个营业日）嵌入验收流程。</li>\n<li>质保索赔的终点是<strong>可调度的返工工单</strong>：复用既有调度管线、携带父引用、沿用原判据版本、做备件预检。</li>\n<li>用一次验收通过率（FPY）与返工率按<strong>技师 × 品类 × 判据项</strong>下钻，把验收质量从一句承诺变成可观测指标。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"完工验收模型：签收确认、验收标准与安装质保","id":"完工验收模型-签收确认-验收标准与安装质保"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：验收是事实转责任的契约动作","id":"核心概念-验收是事实转责任的契约动作"},{"level":2,"text":"验收标准的可执行化：从主观满意到客观判据","id":"验收标准的可执行化-从主观满意到客观判据"},{"level":2,"text":"签收证据链：电子签名、影像、时间戳与不可否认性","id":"签收证据链-电子签名-影像-时间戳与不可否认性"},{"level":2,"text":"安装质保的建模：法定保证、商业质保与手艺质保的分层","id":"安装质保的建模-法定保证-商业质保与手艺质保的分层"},{"level":2,"text":"售后触发与返工：把质保索赔转成可调度的再履约","id":"售后触发与返工-把质保索赔转成可调度的再履约"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"现场异常处置：缺件、环境不达标与安全返工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/field-execution-delivery/onsite-exception-safety-rework"},"next":{"title":"完工结算、技师计酬与安装履约度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/completion-aftersales/completion-settlement-pay-kpi"}}